<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 8</span>: </span><span id="S4.T8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S4.T8.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Text-referenced comparisons with general LLMs.</span> We evaluate several proprietary/budget LLMs against VecGlypher on cross-family OOD fonts. Budget models rarely emit valid SVG; flagship models improve but still trail our approach. VecGlypher-70B (A) attains state-of-the-art performance.
</span></figcaption>
