<span id="A2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">System Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:6.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.32" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 92.63)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a specialized vector glyph designer creating SVG path elements.</span></span>
<span id="A2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Critical requirements:</span></span>
<span id="A2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Each glyph must be a complete, self-contained <math id="A2.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>path<math id="A2.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> element, in reading order of the given text.</span></span>
<span id="A2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Terminate each <math id="A2.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>path<math id="A2.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> element with a newline character.</span></span>
<span id="A2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Output ONLY valid SVG <math id="A2.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>path<math id="A2.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> elements.</span></span>
