</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.pic4" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="92.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 92.52" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,92.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 86.61 C 0 89.87 2.64 92.52 5.91 92.52 L 647.24 92.52 C 650.51 92.52 653.15 89.87 653.15 86.61 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 68.41 L 651.18 68.41 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 77)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.pic4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A2.pic4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Samples of instruction prompts for text-referenced vector glyph generation 1</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.pic4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A2.pic4.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Font design requirements: stiff, wordspace quality, superellipse sans, rounded sans-serif, 400 weight, sans-serif, normal style, display, neo grotesque sans-serif, drawing quality, cute.</span></span>
<span id="A2.pic4.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.pic4.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Text content: V.</span></span>
